OL,3,GNEWSACocaine dealer's sentence cut by  
OL,4,A15 months on appeal                    
OL,6,FA drug dealer linked to #99,000 of     
OL,7,Fcocaine stashed in a self-storage unit 
OL,8,Fnear Isle of Man Airport has had his   
OL,9,Fsentence reduced after an appeal.      
OL,11,FSamsha Sanghera was jailed for 12 years
OL,12,Fand nine months in June after pleading 
OL,13,Fguilty to possession of cocaine with   
OL,14,Fintent to supply.                      
OL,16,FBut appeal judges said his lack of     
OL,17,Fsimilar convictions meant he should    
OL,18,Fhave been given more credit when the   
OL,19,Fsentence was calculated.               
OL,21,FHis sentence was reduced by 15 months  
OL,22,Fto 11 years and four months.           
